// Packet 0810 extends the existing SemIndex owner; every body in this window
// already lives in the canonical shared walker below. No aliases or duplicate
// AST walkers are introduced. These anchors map the Rust items to those bodies.

// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:1776
// normalize_definition -> Structure.jet:339 semindex_normalize_definition.
// Preserves quoted text/escaped scalars; drops // comments and outside whitespace.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:1810
// structural_nodes_from_parsed -> Structure.jet:375 semindex_structural_nodes_from_parsed.
// Sorts copied block spans and traverses the loaded Program using the same
// semindex_collect_item; an empty parsed name ledger is intentional Rust behavior.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:1835
// add_breadcrumb_hints -> Structure.jet:385–410 semindex_breadcrumb_label and
// semindex_add_breadcrumb_hints. Remote methods filter by owner/origin, then sort
// by origin label/name/module/start and retain the exact + signature [path:span].
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:1885
// build_index -> Structure.jet:415 semindex_build_index, with the checked
// registration/source/effect inputs forwarded to Finalize.semindex_build_symbol_db.

// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:1889
// collect_item -> Items.jet:81–222 semindex_collect_item plus
// ItemFacts.jet:17–166 semindex_collect_item_facts/semindex_extern_callable_kind.
// Items owns record/push/state references/pop; its Func/Struct/Enum/Trait/Tag/Impl
// arms retain params, public labels, policies, bypasses, fields, states, payload
// types, member origins, trait requirements and method caller/slot context.
// Remaining arms are ItemFacts' MarkerDecl/FactDecl/Const/Test/ExternRust/Module/
// CodeModule/Distinct/TypeAlias/UnitFamily/ProtocolDecl/UserDerive/TemplateLoop/
// GenericModule/ModuleAlias. CodeModule restores its prior scope; derive loops
// inspect nested sources without inventing recursive expansion. EffectDecl,
// CModule, ErrorConv and Migration are original deliberate no-index arms.
// ExternRust indexes the wrapper contract only, marks failure/generic facts
// unavailable at Typed, and never treats rust_path as a source location.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:2821
// hover_for_fn -> ItemFacts.jet:170 semindex_hover_for_fn. Preserves public label
// head, / and * zones, convention/rest/default text, effective return before
// effect arrow, via, explicit empty effect row, policies and failure source.

// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:2901
// collect_stmts -> Statements.jet:12 semindex_collect_stmts.
