// collect_loop_label_ref -> Statements.jet:23–29 semindex_loop_label_span and
// semindex_collect_loop_label_ref; reference length is UTF-8 bytes, not scalars.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:2930
// collect_stmt -> Statements.jet:31–133 semindex_collect_stmt. Every statement
// arm shares structural slots; runtime/comptime switch arm boundaries, loop
// labels, range/stride/afterthought, unsafe bypasses and context fields retain
// their original traversal order. Break/Continue have no reference payload.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:3155
// collect_lvalue -> Statements.jet:135 semindex_collect_lvalue.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:3179
// collect_binding -> Statements.jet:149 semindex_collect_binding. Destructured
// initializer precedes named definitions; only inferred annotations get inlays.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:3247
// collect_call_inlay_hints -> Statements.jet:170 semindex_collect_call_inlay_hints.
// Uses a binder-slot map; explicit/missing/empty labels and repeated tails skip.

// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:3274
// collect_expr -> Expressions.jet:89–319 semindex_collect_expr. Preserves ghost
// copies, arithmetic facts, calls/member references, explicit drop reason,
// all operand/list/map/tuple/type/fallback slots, lambda/if binding traversal,
// checked origin sentinel AND original source bytes, and all literal leaf arms.
// Canonical optional-call projection at Expressions.jet:68–87 represents Rust's
// CallValue/OptField shape through the same node/slot/reference producers.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:3638
// format_arithmetic_hover -> Expressions.jet:31 semindex_format_arithmetic_hover.
// Rust: crates/jet-semindex/src/Build.rs:3650
// collect_expr_stmt -> Expressions.jet:323 semindex_collect_expr_stmt; only Expr
// and DeferClose recurse, not unrelated statement forms.

